00:00.670 --> 00:01.910
Sekarang, cetak biru

00:01.910 --> 00:02.850
production RAG kita

00:02.850 --> 00:03.450
sudah jelas.

00:04.050 --> 00:04.830
Kita butuh

00:04.830 --> 00:06.180
kontainer terpisah

00:06.180 --> 00:07.820
untuk antarmuka Next.js,

00:07.820 --> 00:09.920
orkestrator Express.js,

00:09.920 --> 00:11.830
antrean dan cache Redis,

00:11.830 --> 00:13.520
database PostgreSQL

00:13.520 --> 00:14.360
pgvector,

00:14.650 --> 00:16.140
serta reverse proxy.

00:17.150 --> 00:17.950
Tapi masalah baru

00:17.950 --> 00:18.550
langsung muncul

00:18.550 --> 00:19.460
di depan mata:

00:20.180 --> 00:21.650
Bagaimana cara menjalankan

00:21.650 --> 00:22.300
kelima layanan

00:22.300 --> 00:23.230
mikroservis ini

00:23.230 --> 00:24.550
di dalam satu VPS murah

00:24.550 --> 00:26.060
berkapasitas 4 GB RAM

00:26.060 --> 00:27.080
tanpa mati mendadak

00:27.080 --> 00:28.460
karena kehabisan memori?

00:29.470 --> 00:30.520
Di bagian kedua,

00:30.520 --> 00:31.910
kita akan bedah tuntas

00:31.910 --> 00:32.980
topologi Docker Compose

00:32.980 --> 00:33.570
dan strategi

00:33.570 --> 00:34.200
pembagian RAM-nya

00:34.200 --> 00:35.800
agar server tetap dingin.
